{"ticker":"AZO","updated":"2026-11-06T22:42:58Z","profile":{"longName":"AutoZone, Inc.","shortName":"AutoZone, Inc.","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Auto Parts","country":"United States","website":"https://www.autozone.com","fullTimeEmployees":79200,"marketCap":51765035008,"trailingPE":21.083908,"forwardPE":16.741644,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.5451677,"pegRatio":1.41,"targetMeanPrice":3665.6086,"targetHighPrice":4450.0,"targetLowPrice":3000.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":23,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.056,"earningsGrowth":0.15,"grossMargins":0.51712,"operatingMargins":0.18034,"profitMargins":0.1265,"totalRevenue":20338554880,"beta":0.373,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":3996.25,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":2730.65,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"AutoZone, Inc. operates as a retailer and distributor of automotive replacement parts and accessories in the Americas. The company offers a product line for cars, sport utility vehicles, vans, and light duty trucks, including new and remanufactured automotive hard parts, maintenance items, accessories, and non-automotive products. It also provides failure products, such as A/C compressors, batteries and accessories, bearings, belts and hoses, calipers, chassis, clutches, CV axles, engines, fuel pumps, fuses, ignition, lighting, mufflers, radiators, starters and alternators, thermostats, tire repair, and water pumps. In addition, the company offers maintenance products, including antifreeze and windshield washer fluid; brake drums, rotors, shoes, and pads; chemicals, including brake and power steering fluid, and oil and fuel additives; oil and transmission fluid; oil, cabin, air, fuel, and transmission filters; oxygen sensors; paint and accessories; refrigerant and accessories; shock absorbers and struts; spark plugs and wires; and windshield wipers. Further, it provides air fresheners, cell phone accessories, drinks and snacks, floor mats and seat covers, interior and exterior accessories, mirrors, performance products protectants and cleaners, sealants and adhesives, steering wheel covers, tools, towing, vehicle entertainment systems, and wash and wax. It offers its products u","summary_zh":"AutoZone, Inc. 在美洲經營汽車更換零件和配件的零售商和分銷商。該公司提供汽車、運動型多用途車、貨車和輕型卡車的產品線，包括新的和再製造的汽車硬零件、維修用品、配件和非汽車產品。它還提供故障產品，如空調壓縮機、電池和配件、軸承、皮帶和軟管、卡鉗、底盤、離合器、CV軸、引擎、燃油泵、保險絲、點火裝置、照明、消音器、散熱器、起動機和交流發電機、恆溫器、輪胎修理和水泵。此外，該公司還提供維護產品，包括防凍劑和擋風玻璃清洗液；煞車鼓、轉子、煞車蹄片和煞車來令片；化學品，包括煞車油和動力轉向液、油品和燃料添加劑；油和傳動液；機油、機艙、空氣、燃油和變速箱濾清器；氧氣感知器；油漆及護罩式風機及護具；此外，該公司還提供空氣清新劑、手機配件、飲料和零食、地墊和座椅套、內部和外部配件、鏡子、高性能產品保護劑和清潔劑、密封劑和粘合劑、方向盤套、工具、拖車、車輛娛樂系統以及清洗和打蠟。它提供其产品u","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"汽車零件","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-08","o":4218.0,"h":4259.2202,"l":4218.0,"c":4242.8799,"v":112900},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":4224.0,"h":4291.1201,"l":4204.3101,"c":4291.1201,"v":94100},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":4282.0,"h":4304.9399,"l":4238.8901,"c":4252.8999,"v":99300},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":4263.8799,"h":4388.1099,"l":4263.8799,"c":4354.54,"v":163200},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":4316.6802,"h":4363.29,"l":4316.6802,"c":4322.1499,"v":100900},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":4334.8101,"h":4357.8101,"l":4198.5601,"c":4233.2998,"v":166800},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":4237.6001,"h":4285.3398,"l":4212.3398,"c":4223.9302,"v":118900},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":4234.9902,"h":4236.6201,"l":4194.2798,"c":4232.5698,"v":106800},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":4223.6099,"h":4235.6802,"l":4112.5098,"c":4132.8301,"v":242600},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":4146.2202,"h":4149.73,"l":4114.5,"c":4140.3599,"v":184600},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":4166.6201,"h":4188.3599,"l":4105.2002,"c":4121.0,"v":192600},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":4034.73,"h":4179.2202,"l":3969.5901,"c":4120.0,"v":263700},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":4109.7202,"h":4228.0,"l":4050.01,"c":4176.8901,"v":183000},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":4176.8901,"h":4176.8901,"l":4090.1699,"c":4136.0698,"v":143000},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":4139.3501,"h":4217.5498,"l":4118.29,"c":4198.0298,"v":87200},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":4189.5601,"h":4276.0,"l":4139.9102,"